Hi {Owner},

I build websites and booking systems for physiotherapy and rehab groups. {Business Name} has grown to several clinics, but the site still has one contact page for all of them, and booking means calling a front desk.

I built a sample rather than ask for your time: a clinic finder, a page per clinic, condition pages that name the nearest location, a therapist directory and online booking by clinic, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If it fits, I finish it on your domain for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, security and edits. Your clinical lead approves every page, and nothing promises a recovery outcome. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Would thirty minutes with you and your operations lead be worth it?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
